    {
      "id": 98365,
      "title": "Pocket - Your notetaker for real world meetings",
      "tagline": "There's a hundred apps for online meetings. This is for everything else.",
      "body": "## **TL;DR**\n\nPocket is a small device that takes notes for all your conversations and meetings. Later, Pocket sends you transcripts, summaries and pulls out your to-dos.\\\n\\\nPocket is taking off. In the last 5 months, we’ve delivered over 30,000 units. **We have a $27M annualized revenue run rate, growing 50% month over month.**\n\n<https://youtu.be/VpNJNPkbsIs>\\\n\\\n**Hey, we're Akshay and Gabriel.**\n\nWe kept noticing the same thing: every important conversation in our lives happened in person - investor meetings, doctor visits, client calls, team standups. And every single note-taking tool on the planet only worked over Zoom.\n\nFor in-person conversations, the best technology available was a pen.\n\n**So we built Pocket.**\n\nPocket is a small device. **Three mics. One button.**\n\nYou press it. You have your conversation. **A summary is waiting for you in the Pocket app.**\n\nThe full transcript too. Pocket tacks who said what. You get automatically-generated summaries. And those things you promised? **We capture all your todos for you.**\n\nWith Pocket, **you don't type. You don't take notes. You can just talk and be present.**\\\n\\\n**It also does something no app can:**\n\nSnap Pocket to the back of your phone. **Its contact mic can capture and summarize both sides of a phone call. No speakerphone required.**\n\nYour doctor calls with test results? Someone rattles off an interesting quote? Your lawyer explains something complicated and fast? **It's all in Pocket. Word for word.**\n\n---\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=98365&key=user_uploads/1169515/acbda200-7586-4988-9cbd-0e54a95b9873)\n\n## **About Us:**\n\nAkshay previously built, Omi, one of the world's largest, open-source AI note-taking devices. He is obsessed with this problem and turned down the Google VR team three times to build Pocket.\n\nGabriel is the former CEO of DoxyChain.\\\n\\\n**How you can help:**\n\n🙏 **Try it!** Order yours today at [**heypocket.com/now**](https://heypocket.com/now). We’d love your feedback.\n\n💬 **Share this** with anyone you know who walks out of meetings thinking, \"wait, what did they say?\"\n\n🔗 **Enterprise/teams** — [**akshay@heypocket.com**](mailto:akshay@heypocket.com). We do bulk orders and deployment.",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/PaX-pocket-your-notetaker-for-real-world-meetings",
      "votes": 493,
